# About GOV.UH Forms

GOV.UH Forms helps government organisations create and publish online forms.

## Creating a form

1. Create a form and give it a name.
2. Add questions to collect the information you need.
3. Add privacy information, contact details and the information people need after submitting the form.
4. Make the form live when it is ready and approved for publication.
5. Link to the form from the relevant GOV.UH service page, with any guidance needed before starting.
6. Receive completed forms through the delivery method configured for the form.

